<http://schema.org/chemicalComposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical composition" .
<http://schema.org/chemicalComposition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The chemical composition describes the identity and relative ratio of the chemical elements that make up the substance." .
