# http://schema.org/hasRepresentation
<http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0000010> .
