<http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has representation" .
<http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A common representation such as a protein sequence or chemical structure for this entity. For images use schema.org/image." .
# 
# http://schema.org/inChIKey
<http://schema.org/inChIKey> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://schema.org/inChIKey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> .
