<http://schema.org/inChIKey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://schema.org/inChIKey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "inchikey" .
<http://schema.org/inChIKey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "InChIKey is a hashed version of the full InChI (using the SHA-256 algorithm)." .
# 
# http://schema.org/iupacName
<http://schema.org/iupacName> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://schema.org/iupacName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> .
