<http://schema.org/iupacName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "iupac name" .
<http://schema.org/iupacName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Systematic method of naming chemical compounds as recommended by the International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry (IUPAC)." .
# 
# http://schema.org/smiles
<http://schema.org/smiles> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://schema.org/smiles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://schema.org/hasRepresentation> .
<http://schema.org/smiles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0000010> .
<http://schema.org/smiles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://schema.org/smiles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "smiles" .
<http://schema.org/smiles> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A specification in form of a line notation for describing the structure of chemical species using short ASCII strings. Double bond stereochemistry \\ indicators may need to be escaped in the string in formats where the backslash is an escape character." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://schema.org/smiles> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0000011> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has core SMILES"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a molecular entity to a SMILES string representing its core structural scaffold."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009102
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009102> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0008000> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has level of theory"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a computational process to the reported level of theory, such as B3LYP, PBE0-D3, or HF-3c."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0001104> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Examples include SHE, NHE, Ag/AgCl, saturated calomel electrode, and ferrocene/ferrocenium."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/ofbo> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has potential reference"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an electrochemical potential quantity to the reference system against which the potential is reported."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0007120> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/ofbo> .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has electron transfer number"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ofbo#OFBO_0009205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an electrochemical reaction to the positive integer number of electrons transferred in that reaction."@en .
