_:genid19 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> .
_:genid19 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (x) (if (Continuant x) (Entity x))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [008-002] " .
_:genid19 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/008-002> .
