_:genid20 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002> .
_:genid20 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> .
_:genid20 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (x) (if (Material Entity x) (exists (t) (and (TemporalRegion t) (existsAt x t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [011-002] " .
