_:genid53 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> .
_:genid53 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (r) (if (SpatioTemporalRegion r) (occupiesSpatioTemporalRegion r r))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [107-002] " .
_:genid53 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/107-002> .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom> .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000011> .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (x t) (if (SpatioTemporalRegion x) (exists (y) (and (SpatialRegion y) (spatiallyProjectsOntoAt x y t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [099-001] " .
_:genid54 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/099-001> .
