_:genid74 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/050-003> .
_:genid75 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom> .
