# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
