<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> "2d-cf-boundary" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> "TwoDimensionalContinuantFiatBoundary" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> "a two-dimensional continuant fiat boundary (surface) is a self-connected fiat surface whose location is defined in relation to some material entity. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [033-001])"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> "(iff (TwoDimensionalContinuantFiatBoundary a) (and (ContinuantFiatBoundary a) (exists (b) (and (TwoDimensionalSpatialRegion b) (forall (t) (locatedInAt a b t)))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [033-001] " .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "two-dimensional continuant fiat boundary"@en .
